WEBVTT

00:32:29.400 --> 00:32:32.115
But one of the lesser-known ways
to give this time meaning

00:32:32.139 --> 00:32:34.652
is to master the art of time travel.

00:32:35.700 --> 00:32:38.686
More specifically, mental time travel.

00:32:38.710 --> 00:32:40.976
In psychology, it's a skill.

00:32:41.000 --> 00:32:42.966
Rewinding to think about the past

00:32:42.990 --> 00:32:45.786
and fast-forwarding to imagine the future.

00:32:45.810 --> 00:32:47.876
It's a distinctively human skill,

00:32:47.900 --> 00:32:49.486
and if we use it thoughtfully,

00:32:49.510 --> 00:32:52.506
it gives us the capacity
to find meaning in the mundane

00:32:52.530 --> 00:32:55.006
and happiness in the midst of sadness,

00:32:55.030 --> 00:32:58.816
and make time pass
faster or slower at will.

00:32:58.840 --> 00:33:01.216
The first destination
for your mental time machine